---
---
<section class="py-32 bg-bg w-full" id="experience">
  <div class="w-full px-6">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex gap-16">
      
      <!-- Left Side - Heading -->
      <div class="w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 pr-8">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-gradient sticky top-32 z-20">Professional Experience</h2>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Right Side - Timeline Container -->
      <div class="w-2/3 relative">
        <!-- Timeline Line -->
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 top-0 w-1 bg-gradient-main h-full z-0"></div>
        
        <!-- Timeline Items -->
        <div class="space-y-16">
        
        <!-- Item 1 - Most Recent -->
        <div class="relative">
          <!-- Timeline Dot -->
          <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-accent rounded-full border-2 border-bg z-10 shadow-glow"></div>
          
          <!-- Content -->
          <article class="bg-bg-secondary border border-border rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-glow hover:border-accent group">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-main transform scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-text">Senior Data Platform Engineer</h3>
            <div class="text-text-secondary text-base mb-2 font-medium">Jimdo GmbH · 2023 — Present</div>
            <div class="text-text-secondary text-base mb-2 font-medium">Interim Data Platform Manager · 2024 — 2025</div>
            <div class="text-text-secondary text-base mb-6 font-medium">Germany & United Kingdom</div>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Stepped into leadership role leading a <strong class="text-text">four-person</strong> data platform engineering team, setting technical priorities, coordinating delivery and removing engineering blockers while remaining hands on.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Led a major platform clean-up and optimisation program, reducing ingestion costs by <strong class="text-text">95%</strong> and ETL costs by <strong class="text-text">20%</strong> while simplifying infrastructure and improving maintainability, governance and reliability.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Migrated from Redshift to Snowflake with zero downtime</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Established reusable infrastructure-as-code and CI/CD patterns using Terraform and GitHub Actions, improving development consistency and accelerating the delivery of data platform changes.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Designed and operated AWS data pipelines ingesting operational data from PostgreSQL, RDS and other APIs into Snowflake using AWS DMS, S3 and dbt, supporting analytics and business-critical data products.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Maintained and evolved a Kafka-based tracking platform processing millions of events daily, managing data quality, schema evolution and pipeline reliability across major analytical workloads.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-border">
              <span class="text-accent text-sm font-medium">Python, SQL, AWS, dbt, Terraform, Airflow, Snowflake, Kafka, Docker, K8s, Grafana</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 2 -->
        <div class="relative">
          <!-- Timeline Dot -->
          <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-accent-secondary rounded-full border-2 border-bg z-10 shadow-glow"></div>
          
          <!-- Content -->
          <article class="bg-bg-secondary border border-border rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-glow hover:border-accent group">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-main transform scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-text">Senior Data Engineer</h3>
            <div class="text-text-secondary text-base mb-2 font-medium">ANZ Plus · 2021 — 2023</div>
            <div class="text-text-secondary text-base mb-6 font-medium">Melbourne, Australia</div>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Helped build ANZ Plus’s greenfield data platform on GCP, using Python, BigQuery and dbt to establish trusted data capabilities for the bank’s flagship digital offering.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Designed reusable tools and frameworks for adjacent data teams, improving engineering consistency and accelerating delivery.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Established project-wide infrastructure-as-code and CI/CD practices using Terraform and GitHub Actions, enabling repeatable, controlled deployments.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Implemented APRA regulatory compliance controls</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Embedded data quality, governance and control requirements into platform development while mentoring graduates and new engineers.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-border">
              <span class="text-accent text-sm font-medium">Python, GCP, dbt, BigQuery, Terraform, GitHub Actions, Jenkins</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 3 -->
        <div class="relative">
          <!-- Timeline Dot -->
          <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-accent-tertiary rounded-full border-2 border-bg z-10 shadow-glow"></div>
          
          <!-- Content -->
          <article class="bg-bg-secondary border border-border rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-glow hover:border-accent group">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-main transform scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-text">Data Engineer</h3>
            <div class="text-text-secondary text-base mb-2 font-medium">Capgemini · 2019 — 2021</div>
            <div class="text-text-secondary text-base mb-6 font-medium">Melbourne, Australia</div>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Designed, built and documented an end-to-end AWS data pipeline for a government department data lake using Glue, Lambda, EMR, PySpark, SQL and Ansible.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Built ETL pipelines processing <strong class="text-text">50TB+</strong> monthly</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Developed batch and streaming ingestion pipelines for a financial-services data lake using AWS, Python, Jenkins, and shell scripts.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Supported one of Australia’s big 4's bank’s metadata program by gathering requirements, validating and transforming source-system metadata, specifically tackling the difficult edge case systems.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                <span class="text-accent text-xs mt-2">▶</span>
                <span>Trained <strong class="text-text">8</strong> junior consultants in best practices</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-border">
              <span class="text-accent text-sm font-medium">AWS, Python, Bash, PySpark</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
